<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Gadzooks sales seen strong.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Gadzooks sales seen strong.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said it reiterated a strong buy rating on Gadzooks Inc.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Anita Gallitano said she expects Gadzooks to post a 10 percent increase in January same-store sales.</p>
<p>-- said Gadzooks's business improved during the holidays and continues to get stronger.</p>
<p>-- Gadzooks was up 2-5/8 to 25-1/2.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street Desk 212-859-1730))</p>
